ides+evenly+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+there%27s+basically+always+a+few+pictures+left+over+at+the+very+end+that+can%27t+form+a+complete+group+of+4.+Those+leftover+pictures+can%27t+use+the+fast+%22recording%22+trick+%28a+CUDA+graph+recording+only+works+on+a+fixed-size+group+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+it+was+recorded+for+exactly+4+pictures%2C+so+you+can%27t+feed+it+2+or+3%29%2C+so+they+just+get+processed+the+normal%2C+slower%2C+step-by-step+way%2C+every+single+time%2C+on+every+single+sentence.+That%27s+completely+separate+from+the+watchdog+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+it+has+nothing+to+do+with+anything+going+wrong%2C+it%27s+just+an+unavoidable+leftover-crumbs+situation+baked+into+how+CUDA+graphs+work.%0ANow%2C+to+your+question+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+would+switching+to+24+pictures-per-second+fix+this%3F+It%27s+a+smart+guess%2C+since+24+divides+evenly+by+4+%2824+%C3%83%C2%B7+4+%3D+6%2C+exactly%29%2C+while+25+does+not.+But+it+wouldn%27t+actually+fix+the+problem%2C+and+here%27s+why%3A+even+at+24+pictures-per-second%2C+you%27d+still+be+multiplying+by+a+messy%2C+random+number+of+seconds+%283.47%2C+5.92%2C+etc.%29%2C+and+a+messy+number+times+24+is+still+going+to+be+a+messy+number+almost+every+time+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+it+only+comes+out+perfectly+even+if+the+speech+happens+to+last+an+exact+whole+number+of+seconds%2C+which+basically+never+happens+with+real+conversation.+So+the+frame+rate+itself+isn%27t+really+the+cause+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+the+real+cause+is+that+speech+clips+have+random+lengths.+The+only+way+to+actually+get+rid+of+the+leftover+pictures+would+be+to+deliberately+pad+every+clip+with+a+few+extra+copies+of+the+last+picture+%28or+a+couple+of+silent%2Fblank+frames%29+at+the+end%2C+just+to+round+the+total+count+up+to+a+clean+multiple+of+4+on+purpose.+That%27s+a+real%2C+doable+fix+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+just+a+different+one+than+changing+the+frame+rate.%0A4.+The+%22recapture+the+recording+per+job%22+tradeoff%2C+explained+slowly%0AMaking+that+%22recording%22+%28the+CUDA+graph+capture%29+isn%27t+instant+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+before+it+can+record+the+steps%2C+the+graphics+card+needs+to+run+a+few+practice+batches+first+to+warm+up+and+settle+on+its+fastest+internal+method+%28the+code%27s+own+notes+mention+this+warm-up+is+required%2C+not+optional%29.+So+every+time+you+throw+away+the+old+recording+and+make+a+fresh+one%2C+you+pay+a+small+chunk+of+extra+time+before+things+speed+back+up.%0ARight+now%2C+that+recording+only+gets+made+ONCE+per+worker+program%27s+entire+lifetime+%28which+could+span+many%2C+many+sentences%2Fconversations%29+unless+the+watchdog+specifically+catches+a+real+problem+and+forces+a+redo.+My+suggestion+was%3A+what+if%2C+instead%2C+we+deliberately+threw+away+and+re-recorded+fresh+at+the+start+of+every+single+new+sentence%2C+on+purpose%2C+regardless+of+whether+anything+went+wrong%3F+The+upside+is+you%27d+never+be+stuck+reusing+a+recording+that%27s+slowly+drifting+bad+over+a+long+conversation+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+every+sentence+starts+clean.+The+downside+is+that+every+single+sentence+would+now+pay+that+warm-up-and-record+cost%2C+making+every+reply+just+a+little+bit+slower+to+start%2C+even+on+the+vast+majority+of+sentences+where+nothing+was+ever+going+to+go+wrong+anyway.+So+it%27s+a+real+trade%3A+a+little+bit+of+speed%2C+given+up+on+every+single+sentence%2C+in+exchange+for+extra+safety+you%27d+only+actually+need+occasionally.%0ADoes+that+make+the+tradeoff+clearer%3F+And+do+you+want+to+go+with+%22fresh+recording+every+sentence%2C%22+or+would+you+rather+explore+something+in+between+%C3%A2%E2%82%AC%E2%80%9D+like+only+re-recording+every+few+sentences%2C+or+only+when+the+graphics+card+has+been+sitting+idle+for+a+while%3F&voice=Freya.wav&language=en&output_file=streaming_output.wav&temperature=1.1 (Caused by NewConnectionError("HTTPConnection(host='127.0.0.1', port=7851): Failed to establish a new connection: [WinError 10061] No connection could be made because the target machine actively refused it"))
